<p>The topic is suggested to me by Alex Guerrero (Rutgers), who, commenting on a social media post by L.A. Paul, writes: &#8220;What are people doing about AI and grad admissions? Writing samples, personal statements. Other fields use interviews; are any philosophy departments considering those as a check on AI assistance?&#8221;</p>
<p>Does your department (or college or university) have a policy or set of practices about this? Do you have thoughts about what such policies or practices should be?</p>
<p>Discussion welcome.</p>
